      "content": "Wait, what? \"Goblin sabotage\" and \"goblin infestation\"? I'm incredibly confused. I thought you were supposed to be a professional providing horticultural advice. \n\nI am asking for a scientific, biological explanation for why my plant is dying. I don't want to hear about folklore or mischievous creatures. Can you please stop the weird stories and just tell me the actual, professional reasons why my leaves would be stunted and why there might be a \"presence\" or something affecting the soil?",
